Mediastreamer uses FFMEPG_SWSCALE as an optional buildtime dependency.  If such
option is on (-DENABLE_FFMPEG=ON) then mediastreamer does not compile as it is
only compatible with ffmpeg 4.x.

Further, the Mediastreamer readme
(https://gitlab.linphone.org/BC/public/mediastreamer2) says ffmpeg support is
unmaintained.  Therefore it seems best to remove the mediastreamer comp-time
dependency on ffmpeg.

